      "id": "p0013-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As of the writing of this book, Undertale has only been officially translated into one language: Japanese. Even so, the game's inherent appeal, together with fan made translations into other languages, has helped Undertale grow from a tiny indie game into a global phenomenon.",
